noPhotos

Alias 	MyLam	Lambda0
Alias	MyLamb	anti-Lambda0

Decay pbarpSystem
  0.5 MyLam anti-Lambda0  	PHSP;
  0.5 Lambda0 MyLamb  		PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay pbarpSystem0
  0.5 MyLam anti-Lambda0  	PHSP;
  0.5 Lambda0 MyLamb  		PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay MyLam
  1.0  p+ pi-      PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay MyLamb
  1.0 anti-p- pi+   PHSP;
Enddecay

End
